## Dashboard Features

This dashboard includes:

- **Main Dashboard**: Overview with statistics and charts
- **User Management**: User listing and management interface
- **Analytics**: Data visualization and reporting
- **Responsive Layout**: Mobile-friendly sidebar navigation
{{#if zustand}}
- **State Management**: Zustand for global state
{{/if}}
{{#if tanstackQuery}}
- **Data Fetching**: TanStack Query for server state
{{/if}}

## Project Structure

- `src/app/` - Next.js App Router pages and layouts
- `src/app/dashboard/` - Dashboard-specific pages
- `src/components/dashboard/` - Dashboard layout components
- `src/components/ui/` - Reusable UI components

